@startuml
title List Languages

actor Admin
participant UI
participant LanguagesController
participant LanguageService
participant LanguageRepository
participant AutoMapper
database Database

== UI Request ==
Admin -> UI : 1. Click "View Languages" or load languages page
activate UI
UI -> LanguagesController : 2. HTTP GET /api/languages (LanguageQueryRequest)
activate LanguagesController

== Service Call ==
LanguagesController -> LanguageService : 3. GetLanguagesAsync(LanguageQueryRequest)
activate LanguageService

== Query Languages ==
LanguageService -> LanguageRepository : 4. GetLanguagesAsync(LanguageQueryRequest)
activate LanguageRepository
LanguageRepository -> Database : 5. SELECT * FROM Languages\nWHERE (@searchTerm IS NULL OR Name LIKE '%' + @searchTerm + '%')\nAND (@status IS NULL OR Status = @status)\nORDER BY @sortBy @sortOrder\nOFFSET @offset ROWS FETCH NEXT @pageSize ROWS ONLY
activate Database
Database --> LanguageRepository : 6. List<LanguageEntity>
deactivate Database

LanguageRepository -> Database : 7. SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Languages\nWHERE (@searchTerm IS NULL OR Name LIKE '%' + @searchTerm + '%')\nAND (@status IS NULL OR Status = @status)
activate Database
Database --> LanguageRepository : 8. TotalCount
deactivate Database
LanguageRepository --> LanguageService : 9. (List<LanguageEntity>, TotalCount)
deactivate LanguageRepository

== Map to DTOs ==
LanguageService -> AutoMapper : 10. Map((List<LanguageEntity>, TotalCount) → LanguageListResponse)
activate AutoMapper
AutoMapper --> LanguageService : 11. LanguageListResponse
deactivate AutoMapper

== Set Pagination Info ==
LanguageService -> LanguageService : 12. Set pagination info (PageNumber, PageSize, TotalPages)
activate LanguageService
deactivate LanguageService

LanguageService --> LanguagesController : 13. LanguageListResponse
deactivate LanguageService

LanguagesController --> UI : 14. HTTP 200 OK (LanguageListResponse)
deactivate LanguagesController

UI --> Admin : 15. Render languages list on screen
deactivate UI

@enduml
